  "display_title": "Red and Blue Eyes",
  "description": "A world where magic exists.\nThe famous wizards known as “red and blue eyes” are considered nothing more than a legend after being assassinated for their special abilities. In modern times, they appear as heroes in movies and soap operas and thus become wildly popular.\nThe newly elected minister of magic announces his plan to destroy the magic ball that caused a disaster. Heera, who has been hiding her identity as “red and blue eyes” her whole life, joins in the effort to break up the magic ball for her sick daughter. \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
